  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Cooperation EU-LAC for CRM through Geological Surveys - EULACRM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;EU and LAC collaboration on critical raw materials can contribute to generate sustainable investments. Geological surveys play a crucial role in several key parts of raw material value chains, from the exploration stage to the post-closure phase. Given the importance of secondary raw materials, Geological Surveys are key elements to tackle the mineral supply potential of mining wastes. The project has two main objective:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Strengthen cooperation between EU-LAC Geological Surveys on the evaluation of both primary and secondary raw materials.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Provide technical assistance for targeted local studies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
